#X text 40 20 [tab] has four colors: the background \, the fill of the active tab \, the text of the inactive tabs (which also draws the dividers) and the text of the active tab., f 56;
#X text 40 70 Set them with the 'bgcolor' \, 'activecolor' \, 'fgcolor' and 'activetextcolor' messages \, or with the matching flags. Colors are in RGB., f 56;
