#X text 93 157 -fgcolor <f \, f \, f>: sets text and divider color in RGB, f 76;
#X text 93 172 -activetextcolor <f \, f \, f>: sets active tab text color in RGB, f 76;
#X text 93 187 -send <symbol>: sets send symbol (default empty), f 76;
